[{"type": "subtitle", "time": 15600.79, "timestamp": "04:20:00", "text": "皆さん、善行をしてください。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 15603.269, "timestamp": "04:20:03", "text": "いつも善行をする必要はありません。いいですか？"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 15605.83, "timestamp": "04:20:05", "text": "それを覚えておいてください。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 15607.91, "timestamp": "04:20:07", "text": "人を助けてください。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 15610.149, "timestamp": "04:20:10", "text": "小さなことでも、自分のやりたいことをしてください。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 15613.03, "timestamp": "04:20:13", "text": "いいですか？"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 15617.83, "timestamp": "04:20:17", "text": "そして、もっと幸せになり、もっと"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 15621.269, "timestamp": "04:20:21", "text": "自分に自信を持ってください。こんにちは。"}, {"type": "chat", "time": 15621.596, "timestamp": "04:20:21", "author": "@Surya_VT", "avatar": "https://yt4.ggpht.com/xYZGMsDSkF4w1IOdT2xKmMHI-M3-NParGStQvKERjxxwivecaInz95y5n8jliQSZ7SgMMYzdrw=s64-c-k-c0x00ffffff-no-rj", "message": "Will do"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 15623.91, "timestamp": "04:20:23", "text": "そして、次に私を見るときには"}, {"type": "chat", "time": 15626.025, "timestamp": "04:20:26", "author": "@Surya_VT", "avatar": "https://yt4.ggpht.com/xYZGMsDSkF4w1IOdT2xKmMHI-M3-NParGStQvKERjxxwivecaInz95y5n8jliQSZ7SgMMYzdrw=s64-c-k-c0x00ffffff-no-rj", "message": "UCkszU2WH9gy1mb0dV-11UJg/G8AfY6yWGuKuhL0PlbiA2AEUCkszU2WH9gy1mb0dV-11UJg/G8AfY6yWGuKuhL0PlbiA2AEUCkszU2WH9gy1mb0dV-11UJg/G8AfY6yWGuKuhL0PlbiA2AE"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 15628.07, "timestamp": "04:20:28", "text": "、私は変わった人間になっているかもしれません"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 15636.55, "timestamp": "04:20:36", "text": "。次は変わったアスリートになっているかもしれません。誰にもわかりません。そして、私自身もそれを見ることができると信じています。だから、"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 15640.149, "timestamp": "04:20:40", "text": "その瞬間が待ちきれません。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 15642.79, "timestamp": "04:20:42", "text": "皆さん、"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 15646.07, "timestamp": "04:20:46", "text": "善行などをすることを忘れないでください"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 15648.229, "timestamp": "04:20:48", "text": "。それでは、皆さん、良い一日を。ご"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 15651.03, "timestamp": "04:20:51", "text": "視聴ありがとうございました。"}, {"type": "chat", "time": 15656.07, "timestamp": "04:20:56", "author": "@Surya_VT", "avatar": "https://yt4.ggpht.com/xYZGMsDSkF4w1IOdT2xKmMHI-M3-NParGStQvKERjxxwivecaInz95y5n8jliQSZ7SgMMYzdrw=s64-c-k-c0x00ffffff-no-rj", "message": "mhm"}]